ion\">\n                        A Claude Agent SDK with web browsing capabilities, enabling agents to navigate and interact with web pages.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">GitHub Trending</span>\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-01</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"320 stars in one day\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/mindra\" target=\"_blank\">Mindra</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Agent teams you can actually delegate to - AI agent system for task delegation and workflow automation.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-05</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Agent Teams You Can Actually Delegate To\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/flowly\" target=\"_blank\">Flowly</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Your personal AI assistant, native to your desktop - desktop-based AI assistant for developers.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n             