                <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/billy-sh\" target=\"_blank\">Billy.sh</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Local AI coding assistant for terminal using Ollama - open-source, local-first approach to AI coding assistance.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-01</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Uses Ollama for local inference\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/logicoal\" target=\"_blank\">LogiCoal</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        AI multi-agent coding assistant for terminal that handles coding tasks with multi-agent orchestration.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-04-29</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Multi-agent orchestration for coding tasks\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46703935\" target=\"_blank\">Architect</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Terminal built on ghostty-vt terminal emulation for managing multiple AI coding agents. Integrates with Claude Code, Gemini CLI, and Codex agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Show HN</span>\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-04-25</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"A terminal for running multiple AI coding agents\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46368739\" target=\"_blank\">Superset</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Open-source terminal designed for managing multiple coding agents (Claude Code, Codex, etc.) in parallel. Can run up to 10 coding agents simultaneously.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Show HN</span>\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-04-22</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Terminal to run 10 parallel coding agents\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47520220\" target=\"_blank\">Optio</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Orchestrates AI coding agents in Kubernetes to automate from ticket to PR with CI/CD feedback loops.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Show HN</span>\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-04-24</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Orchestrates AI coding agents in Kubernetes\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/struct-2\" target=\"_blank\">Struct</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        AI agent that root-causes engineering alerts using logs, metrics, traces, and code with composable architecture.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-04-23</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Root-causes engineering alerts\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/plandex-ai/plandex\" target=\"_blank\">Plandex</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Open-source AI coding agent for large projects - terminal-based tool for planning and executing complex coding tasks.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">GitHub</span>\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-04-27</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Open-source AI coding agent for large projects\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/omnara-ai/omnara\" target=\"_blank\">Omnara</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        AI agent platform that syncs across terminal, web dashboard, and mobile with Claude Code integration - YC S25 startup.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">GitHub</span>\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-04-26</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"YC S25 startup\"</div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                <h2>Product Updates <span class=\"section-count\">(5)</span></h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"product-name\">GitHub Copilot</span>: Visual Studio April Update\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        April 2026 update centers on agentic workflows: cloud agent sessions launch directly from IDE, custom agents gain user-level support in %USERPROFILE%/.github/agents/, new Debugger agent validates fixes against live runtime behavior, customizable keyboard shortcuts, new chat history panel, and C++ code editing tools now generally available.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-04-30</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-04-30-github-copilot-in-visual-studio-april-update/\" target=\"_blank\">View Changelog →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"product-name\">Aider</span>: v0.86.0\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Added support for all GPT-5 models, added support for Grok-4 via xai/grok-4 and openrouter/x-ai/grok-4 model names, added support for gemini-2.5-flash-lite-preview-06-17 model, improved /clear and /undo commands, fixed settings replacement issue, and bumped dependencies to litellm 1.75.0.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-04-29</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/Aider-AI/aider/releases\" target=\"_blank\">View Release →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"product-name\">Claude Code</span>: Week 17 Updates\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        /ultrareview opens as a research preview, automatic session recaps when returning to terminal, custom color themes for plugins, redesigned web version with sessions sidebar and drag-and-drop layout, Vim visual mode support, hooks can call MCP tools, and performance improvements including 67% faster /resume on large sessions.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-04-24</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new/2026-w17\" target=\"_blank\">View What's New →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"product-name\">Devin</span>: v2.2 Release\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Desktop support enabled by default for new users, existing users can enable through Settings, enhanced session management indicating 'Action Required' state, minor bug fixes and polish.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-04-24</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/2026\" target=\"_blank\">View Release Notes →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"product-name\">Aider</span>: v0.85.0\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Added support for new Gemini 2.5 models (pro, flash, preview) with thinking tokens, support for o1-pro and o3-pro models, enhanced thinking tokens configuration, increased max tokens for Deepseek models, new --add-gitignore-files flag, co-authored-by attribution enabled by default, --commit-language option, improved commit message generation, MATLAB and Clojure language support for repository maps.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-04-19</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/Aider-AI/aider/releases\" target=\"_blank\">View Release →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section class=\"technical-insights\">\n                <h2>Technical Insights <span class=\"section-count\">(0)</span></h2>\n                <div class=\"empty-state\">\n                    No technical insights available for this date.\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <a href=\"#\">Archives</a>\n            <a href=\"#\">About</a>\n            <a href=\"#\">API</a>\n            <a href=\"#\">Contact</a>\n            <div style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">\n                Generated with <a href=\"https://claude.com/claude-code\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code</a>\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
